5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know the total cost before we book anything.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m tired of losing two days to travel. I need to see how much time we actually get to relax.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I need to verify the payment structure. Who covers what, and when, must be explicit to avoid hidden costs.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I need to check the bathing hours and bathroom provision. I can't sleep if I'm waiting for a hot bath.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to understand how last year's days actually ran. The structure determines whether we feel connected or isolated.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, I agree. Travel time is lost time. Let's check the ferry and train schedules to see if we can save a day.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, exactly. If the ferry is slow, we lose another half-day. I’ll check the train and bus options to see if we can cut the transit time.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, I will check the all-in rates against separate meals. Bundling costs prevents individual billing disputes and clarifies the total financial exposure for the group.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I’m checking the bathing hours and bathroom provision. I need to know if I can wash without waiting in line.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, I appreciate the focus on comfort. I will examine the time alone in the shared-house year to see if the layout creates distance.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, that sounds smart. I want to see the all-in rates too, so I know the exact total before we sign anything.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
