35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"- **Rin**: @Asuka, I found that all-in rates charge light eaters the same as big eaters. I need to know the exact total before we commit.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the ferry is a trap. Last one back is 16:20, so we lose two full days. I need to see if the train saves us that time.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the data confirms my concern. Last year, individual room bookings varied by 8,000 yen. A whole-building rent creates one bill, eliminating hidden individual burdens.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, I found the inn baths close at midnight, but there’s only one bathroom for the whole building. I can’t sleep if I’m waiting in line for hot water.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the single bathroom is a bottleneck. I found that last year, two of us went from breakfast to dinner without meeting. A shared house isolates us; a town absorbs that need for space.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, losing two days is awful. I need the exact total cost so I don't get surprised by extra fees later.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train is ninety minutes, but the valley bus stops at seven. We’d be stuck there. I need to see if the city option avoids that trap.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the train saves time, but the cost structure matters more. If we rent the building whole, the bill is one number. No one is left guessing their share.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, the valley bus is a trap. I need a place where I can wash and eat without a rigid schedule.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the train saves time, but the valley bus is a trap. I need a place where we can move together without being forced into a single schedule.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, one bill is great, but I need the exact number. I hate surprises. What is the total for the whole week?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the city trains run every few minutes. No waiting, no planning. We get the whole week back. That is the only option that respects our time.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the total is fixed by the building rent. No variable meal costs, no individual room premiums. The financial risk is eliminated by the structure itself.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, I agree. The city room has a door and no timetable. I can wash and eat when I want. That is the only way I can sleep properly.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, a private door is essential. Last year, the shared house forced us into proximity without giving us space to breathe. I need that balance.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I still need the exact number. If the total is fixed, tell me what it is. I refuse to sign anything without seeing the final cost.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, I don't have the price tag, but I have the time. The city gives us the week back. I’m done losing days to transit.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, I do not have the final figure yet. I have the structure. The exact number requires the pricing data we have not yet gathered.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, I can't give you the number, but I can give you the freedom. A city room means I sleep without a schedule. That is my priority.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the structure is clear. A city room offers the balance we need: together, yet with space to breathe. I am ready to see the options.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
